From dc851a6b5518e6a559154e654a7429992ae1456e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chelsio Cudbg <chelsiocudbg@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Jan 2026 18:50:08 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] cstor: add T7 support for NVMEtcp for RHEL9.6

cxgb4: remove cxgb4_lld_info in cxgb4_rdma_resource.h

iw_cxgb4/cxgb4: move act_open_has_tid() to t4_msg.h

cxgb4: fix control queue allocation

cxgb4: add code to increment num_ofld_uld and num_uld

iw_cxgb4: add common resource support

cxgb4: add cstor uld support

cxgb4: add macros required for cstor driver

cstor: add user mode NVMe/TCP and iSCSI offload driver
